    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.21,
      214.18,
      526.77,
      232.59
    ],
    "text": "\"A right of appeal is a statutory right and must be expressly created and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.14,
      238.67,
      526.83,
      257.08
    ],
    "text": "granted by the statute. It cannot be implied. Article 138 is only an enabling",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.789496421813965,
      13.800000190734863,
      14.24643325805664
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.2,
      262.92,
      526.54,
      281.32
    ],
    "text": "Article and it confers the jurisdiction to hear and determine appeals to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.09,
      287.15,
      525.93,
      305.57
    ],
    "text": "Court of Appeal. The right to avail of or take advantage of that jurisdiction is",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.533221244812012,
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047,
      14.531891822814941
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.36,
      311.39,
      526.61,
      329.8
    ],
    "text": "governed by the several statutory provisions in various legislative",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.09,
      335.87,
      164.97,
      354.28
    ],
    "text": "enactments.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      141.33,
      384.59,
      526.58,
      403.0
    ],
    "text": "Applying the principles laid down in the above judicial decision, I",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
